Session 5, 2026-09-05, Ag Leader InCommand 1200 (New Holland tractor).
Run 1 -- first confirmed correlation between a live power-cycle and the VT
fault. Predates the vtstat= counter (added after this run, see run 2/run 3).
Two boot sequences visible: an early one is leftover serial-menu state from
before the actual power cycle; the real boot starts at t=14.598 after the
port drops and reconnects (~t=3.7 to ~t=11.3).

Timestamps are seconds since the logging script attached to COM4, not since
board reset.

